event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_018dee8eb334bf70016acb09658490819689f2b39c70e7b91a","output_index":0,"sequence_number":82,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing location tests**\n\nI'm considering ways to preserve old location tests while omitting the priority filter. It sounds like all redirects should be optional, and I’m thinking about implementing this in Python. I’ll want to focus on editing rules precisely, especially when it comes to editing bulk-generated tool text. There’s a lot to think about, and I want to get it right. Let’s explore the best approach!"}

